<h1 data-copy-en="Maggie" data-copy-zh="Maggie">Maggie</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Maggie’s work-experience milestones, skills, dates and evening invitations." data-copy-zh="Maggie的工作经验门槛、技能、约会与晚间邀约。">Maggie’s work-experience milestones, skills, dates and evening invitations.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Maggie</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Corporate_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Parenthood_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Hub_Branches_and_Intimacy_Experience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Lunch_Break_with_Maggie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Night_Club_Accepted_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_Accepted_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="KTV_and_Night_Club_Invitations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Best_Investment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_View"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Formal_Outfit_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Earning_Working_Experience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Maggie — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/maggie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Maggie — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/maggie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Maggie — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Maggie’s route combines office work, Formal Outfit upgrades and friendship. The investment-room milestones teach two useful work skills; her dates and personal conversations unlock alongside them.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>Where to find Maggie</h2><p>Visit Present → Downtown → Office Building → Investment Planning, 13:00–17:00, for the first meeting. Her morning portrait in Offices, 09:00–13:00, requires Known (25).</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Offices</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–13:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Known (25)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Investment Planning</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>After the introduction, return with 15 Working Experience and Formal Outfit level 2 for A Partnership Worth Earning, which teaches Diligent Worker. At 80 experience and outfit level 3, The Eye for Value teaches Business Acumen. At 150 experience, with outfit level 3 or better, continue with Work Hard, Play Harder. These three encounters start 13:00–17:00.</p><p>Her morning heart-to-heart is selected as A Quiet Moment; its conversation heading is The View. The afternoon action Between Meetings opens after the final work milestone. The dates are once-only and do not replace either heart-to-heart.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">An Ambitious Introduction</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Maggie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Partnership Worth Earning</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after An Ambitious Introduction; Working Experience 15; Formal Outfit level 2</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Maggie +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Eye for Value</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after A Partnership Worth Earning; Working Experience 80; Formal Outfit level 3</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Maggie +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Work Hard, Play Harder</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Eye for Value; Working Experience 150; Formal Outfit level 3</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Maggie +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Eye for Acquisition</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Wrong Office / The Eye for Value</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Maggie +8 / Miki +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">His Name on the Door</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Investment Planning; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Eye for Acquisition; own 1 companies</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Miki +7 / Maggie +5 / Arnold +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hostile Mentorship</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Still Not an Appointment</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Maggie +10 / Miki +5 / Arnold +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">A Quiet Moment</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Offices; 09:00–13:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after A Partnership Worth Earning</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; −10 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoo Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after A Partnership Worth Earning</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); not currently pregnant</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Picnic Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Eye for Value</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $30; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Between Meetings</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Work Hard, Play Harder</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; −10 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Visit_and_Ending"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Visit_Maggie_.E2.80.94_A_Night_Off_the_Clock"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Visit_Maggie_—_A_Night_Off_the_Clock"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Career_Encounters_and_Skill_Rewards"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk gives 1 base point, with five safe uses shared between both office locations. Lunch Break is also shared across its two locations: the effective start window is 11:00–13:00 in Offices or 13:00–15:00 in Investment Planning.</p><p>At Crush (400), after Work Hard, Play Harder, Maggie joins the KTV and Night Club invitation lists. Start 20:00–23:00: KTV costs 120 minutes, $150 and 40 Energy; Night Club costs 120 minutes, $100 and 30 Energy. Each venue permits one invitation per day across its guest list, with the corresponding content access required.</p><p>The separate apartment visit requires Romantic (800) and the final work milestone. Start at the Downtown Apartment Complex 20:00–24:00; it costs 150 minutes and 55 Energy, once daily.</p><p>Listed relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers can change the final gain. Daily allowances for the same action follow the character across locations; starting it elsewhere does not create a fresh allowance.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Intelligence 45 / Commerce 40 / Communication 38</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Investment Savvy</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Maggie</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Offices; 09:00–13:00<br/>Investment Planning; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 5 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lunch Break with Maggie</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Offices; 11:00–13:00<br/>Investment Planning; 13:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +50; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Visit Maggie</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Apartment Complex; 20:00–24:00 (location action)</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">150 min; −55 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Heart-to-heart reward reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Conversation</th><th scope="col">Best ordinary base total</th><th scope="col">Useful special replies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The View</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">38</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">round 2: Empathy (+2 base); round 5: Charm 40 (+2 base)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Best Investment</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">45</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">round 2: Empathy (+1 base); round 4: Charm 40 (+1 base)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These totals describe the best ordinary choices, before relationship modifiers. A special reply can improve the reward; it is not required just to finish the conversation. Romantic adds 25 final relationship points on completion.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>Work experience and the required outfit are separate checks; a high relationship stage does not bypass them. The zoo invitation is only offered from her afternoon portrait, so its practical start window is 13:00–17:00. The Voucher Fair invitation likewise starts 13:00–17:00.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">Investment System</a> · <a href="walkthrough-wealth-guide.html">Wealth Guide</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Corporate_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Parenthood_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Hub_Branches_and_Intimacy_Experience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Lunch_Break_with_Maggie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Night_Club_Accepted_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_Accepted_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-KTV_and_Night_Club_Invitations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Best_Investment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_View"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Formal_Outfit_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Earning_Working_Experience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Maggie 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/maggie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Maggie 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/maggie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Maggie 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Maggie的路线结合工作经验、正装升级与关系进展。投资规划室中的里程碑会教会两项实用工作技能，同时逐步开放约会和个人谈心。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>初次见面请前往现代 → 市中心 → 办公大楼 → 投资规划，时间为13:00—17:00。她上午09:00—13:00在办公室出现，但这处头像需要已知（25）关系。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">办公室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–13:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">投资规划</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>初见之后，准备15点工作经验和2级正装，返回触发值得挣来的合伙关系，学会勤勉工作者。工作经验80、正装3级时，识价的眼光会教会商业头脑。工作经验达到150、正装仍为3级以上时，继续拼命工作，尽情玩乐。这三项事件都在13:00—17:00开始。</p><p>上午谈心请选静谧片刻，进入后的对话标题与按钮略有不同。下午的会议间隙的片刻则在最后一个工作里程碑后开放。各项约会只能完成一次，也不能代替这两段谈心。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">野心勃勃的初见</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Maggie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">值得挣来的合伙关系</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：野心勃勃的初见；工作经验15；正装等级2</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Maggie +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">识价的眼光</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：值得挣来的合伙关系；工作经验80；正装等级3</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Maggie +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">拼命工作，尽情玩乐</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：识价的眼光；工作经验150；正装等级3</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Maggie +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">收购眼光</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：走错办公室、识价的眼光</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Maggie +8、Miki +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">门上的名字</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">投资规划; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：收购眼光；拥有1家公司</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Miki +7、Maggie +5、Arnold +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">敌意式指导</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：仍然没有预约</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Maggie +10、Miki +5、Arnold +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">静谧片刻</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">办公室; 09:00–13:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：值得挣来的合伙关系</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟；−10 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">动物园约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：值得挣来的合伙关系</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富100；−50 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；当前未怀孕</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">野餐约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：识价的眼光</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富30；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">会议间隙的片刻</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：拼命工作，尽情玩乐</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟；−10 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Visit_and_Ending"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Visit_Maggie_.E2.80.94_A_Night_Off_the_Clock"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Visit_Maggie_—_A_Night_Off_the_Clock"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Career_Encounters_and_Skill_Rewards"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈每次获得1点基础关系，两处办公室共用每日5次安全额度。午休互动也共用两处地点的额度：在办公室实际可开始于11:00—13:00，在投资规划室则为13:00—15:00。</p><p>达到迷恋（400）并完成拼命工作，尽情玩乐后，Maggie会加入KTV和夜总会邀约名单。20:00—23:00开始：KTV消耗120分钟、150财富、40精力；夜总会消耗120分钟、100财富、30精力。每个场所的全部来宾共用每日一次邀请额度，并需要相应内容访问权限。</p><p>独立的公寓拜访要求浪漫感（800）及最后的工作里程碑。在市中心公寓大楼20:00—24:00开始，消耗150分钟、55精力，每日一次。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，所列关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量会受共通关系修正影响。同一动作的每日额度跟随角色计算，换地点不会获得新额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">智力 45、商业 40、沟通 38</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">投资眼光</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Maggie 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">办公室; 09:00–13:00<br/>投资规划; 13:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；5次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">午餐时间与Maggie</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">办公室; 11:00–13:00<br/>投资规划; 13:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；−45 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+50；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">拜访Maggie</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">公寓楼; 20:00–24:00（地点动作）</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">150分钟；−55 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开谈心奖励参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">最佳普通选择基础总值</th><th scope="col">实用特殊回复条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">风景</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">38</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">第2轮: 共情（+2基础点）; 第5轮: 魅力 40（+2基础点）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">最好的投资</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">45</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">第2轮: 共情（+1基础点）; 第4轮: 魅力 40（+1基础点）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>总值为普通选项的最佳基础合计，尚未套用关系修正。特殊回复可提高奖励，但不是完成谈心的必要条件；学会浪漫后，完成时另加25点最终关系。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>工作经验和正装等级分别检查，关系再高也不能跳过。动物园约会只绑定下午头像，因此实际开始时段为13:00—17:00；兑换券游园会邀约也同样需要在13:00—17:00开始。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密互动</a> · <a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">投资系统</a> · <a href="walkthrough-wealth-guide.html">财富指南</a></p></section>
